& [CanonicalRecord: FSC1FinalSlices] is the processed planning authority for FSC1 final work slices
  + [canonical_uuid] is 4c6e84da-002c-4b05-8f3a-3c6e97f51834
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 0ac1b1f3-b31f-4601-9414-f39a7243e74d
  + [exploded_uuid] is 02499add-d02d-4a1a-bd20-8e3abcbe3b17
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is 060f6f10-0a74-4873-bad8-274b27d4f7eb
  + [authority_scope] is FSC1 slice order, slice readiness, slice gates, model routing, expected outputs, and verification oracles
  + [implementation_scope] is final slice planning authority only
  + [depends_on] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Final_Slicing_Surface.canonical.sop

  = must: use docs/slices/FSC1_Final_Slices.v1.sop as the current FSC1 slice surface
  = must: execute FSC1-S01 first
  = must: run completion review after each slice before opening the next gated slice
  = must: keep downstream FSC2 through FSC5 work gated until FSC1-S07 accepts the foundation contract pack
  - never: treat FSC1 slice records as implementation proof

& [CanonicalFSC1SliceSet] is the final FSC1 slice sequence
  + [slice] is FSC1-S01 kernel record core schema
  + [slice] is FSC1-S02 record-specific schema and natural-key matrix
  + [slice] is FSC1-S03 operator contract template
  + [slice] is FSC1-S04 foundation operator contracts
  + [slice] is FSC1-S05 storage backend decision
  + [slice] is FSC1-S06 foundation fixture plan
  + [slice] is FSC1-S07 FSC1 completion review and activation packet

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes FSC1
  = must: mark downstream slices stale when an upstream accepted output changes

& [CanonicalFSC1ExecutionGate] is the activation rule for FSC1
  + [current_ready_slice] is FSC1-S01
  + [gated_slice] is FSC1-S02 until FSC1-S01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC1-S03 until FSC1-S02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC1-S04 until FSC1-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC1-S05 until FSC1-S02 and FSC1-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC1-S06 until FSC1-S04 and FSC1-S05 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC1-S07 until FSC1-S06 accepted
  + [completion_gate] is FSC1 foundation contract pack accepted after FSC1-S07

  = must: expose only FSC1-S01 as ready right now
  = must: keep all later slices gated inside FSC1

& [CanonicalFSC1ModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [FSC1-S01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC1-S02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC1-S03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC1-S04] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC1-S05] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC1-S06] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after FSC1-S01 through FSC1-S05 are accepted
  + [FSC1-S07] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep schema, natural keys, authority states, operator contract boundaries, storage decision, and final acceptance under deeper reasoning
  = should: route FSC1-S06 to GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark only after the contract inputs are accepted and stable

